Text: For our experiments, we use only the response texts and assign a binary FACT or FEEL label to each response: texts with score > 1 are assigned to the FACT class and texts with score < -1 are assigned to the FEELING class. We did not use the responses with scores between -1 and 1 because they had a very weak Fact/Feeling assessment, which could be attributed to responses either containing aspects of both factual and feeling expression, or neither.

